{"h":3395,"lines":[{"y":0.046511627815394085,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":0.30000001192092896,"t":"1718867188","w":0.069958845774332645,"x":0.7716049391467531},{"w":0.057613169352213542,"x":0.1172839502042468,"t":"Test 4","h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"y":0.053779069625663367},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.54651162770558526,"c":1,"t":"Fr","x":0.11728395041876481,"w":0.014403292338053389},{"c":1,"y":0.097383720781296423,"t":"Ogilvie and her team have been building the vast database of material possessions on top","x":0.15637861043756962,"w":0.71399175008138027,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"c":1,"t":"of their full demographic reconstruction of the people who lived in these two German","x":0.15843621105603328,"w":0.68518519083658846,"y":0.11482558126232711,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"w":0.71193415323893228,"t":"communities.ạỊWe can follow the same people - and their descendants - across 300 years","y":0.1322143695964465,"c":1,"x":0.16049382863136324,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"t":"of educational and economic change,' she says. Individual lives have unfolded before their","x":0.16049383463469324,"y":0.1468023258394805,"w":0.72016459147135414,"c":1,"h":0.016036307713448994},{"y":0.16569767428569682,"t":"eyes. Stories like that of the 24-year-olds Ana Regina and Magdalena Riethmüllerin, who","w":0.71399175008138016,"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.15843622362705409,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.73056793212890625,"t":"were chastised in 1707 for reading books in church instead of listening to the sermon.ạẠạỊThis","x":0.16043658705406927,"y":0.18011881817149178,"h":0.017819343944320387},{"w":0.71193415323893228,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.15843621549028417,"t":"tells us they were continuing to develop their reading skills at least a decade after leaving","c":1,"y":0.19758539481378357},{"x":0.1584362164057336,"w":0.70576131184895841,"y":0.21366279055135051,"t":"school,' explains Ogilvie. The database also reveals the case of Juliana Schweickherdt, a","h":0.016019188192342826,"c":1},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.23110465101649291,"w":0.69135803222656245,"t":"50-year-old spinster living in the small Black Forest community of Wildberg, who was","c":1,"x":0.16049382328360196},{"y":0.24558303913451118,"x":0.15843623432777945,"w":0.69753082275390643,"c":1,"t":"reprimanded in 1752 by the local weavers' guild for 'weaving cloth and combing wool,","h":0.017498355591395343},{"h":0.017667844522968101,"c":1,"w":0.73456787109374988,"y":0.26295641926862001,"x":0.15843622589859829,"t":"counter to the guild ordinance'. When Juliana continued taking jobs reserved for male guild"},{"t":"members, she was summoned before the guild court and told to pay a fine equivalent to one","x":0.16045044186833479,"c":1,"y":0.28024916861967575,"w":0.73054585774739589,"h":0.016345146547638745},{"y":0.29796511615951582,"t":"third of a servant's annual wage. It was a small act of defiance by today's standards, but it","x":0.16049382862272807,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"w":0.71193415323893228},{"t":"reflects a time when laws in Germany and elsewhere regulated people's access to labour","x":0.15843620825688598,"w":0.70370371500651041,"c":1,"y":0.31389870418370036,"h":0.016043156420524673},{"x":0.15843621985641534,"y":0.3312720848816294,"t":"markets. The dominance of guilds not only prevented people from using their skills, but also","w":0.73868311564127598,"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"h":0.0182701241141634,"c":1,"x":0.15824874183620571,"w":0.39958211263020826,"t":"held back even the simplest industrial innovation.","y":0.34517463721035502},{"y":0.37919114357988515,"c":1,"t":"The data-gathering phase of the project has been completed and now, according to Ogilvie,","x":0.16042802907191722,"w":0.72646967569986975,"h":0.017644093651653647},{"h":0.014563987898180697,"y":0.39680232544746163,"w":0.72633743286132812,"t":"it is time 'to ask the big questions'. One way to look at whether education causes economic","x":0.16049383496597613,"c":1},{"w":0.73662551879882809,"y":0.41279069789253287,"c":1,"h":0.015988371257085521,"x":0.16049382249359023,"t":"growth is to 'hold wealth constant'. This involves following the lives of different people with"},{"x":0.15843621169428113,"w":0.7366255187988282,"c":1,"h":0.016008916255020766,"t":"the same level of wealth over a period of time. If wealth is constant, it is possible to discover","y":0.43021201411848575},{"w":0.67078191121419273,"c":1,"x":0.16049381795257442,"y":0.44758539482771553,"t":"whether education was, for example, linked to the cultivation of new crops, or to the","h":0.01472320376914027},{"x":0.15843620351818458,"y":0.46366279056475213,"w":0.73456792195638021,"c":1,"h":0.014546867815428799,"t":"adoption of industrial innovations like sewing machines. The team will also ask what aspect"},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"of education helped people engage more with productive and innovative activities. Was it,","y":0.47965116264441687,"x":0.16049383680063906,"w":0.71399175008138016,"c":1},{"w":0.72644714355468754,"x":0.15837562976193073,"t":"for instance, literacy, numeracy, book ownership, years of schooling? Was there a threshold","y":0.4955614635724841,"h":0.018851883419832127,"c":1},{"w":0.66666666666666663,"x":0.1584362139018389,"y":0.51295641949690951,"t":"level - a tipping point - that needed to be reached to affect economic performance?","c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.16049383333372513,"w":0.68106994628906248,"y":0.54651162776079387,"t":"Ogilvie hopes to start finding answers to these questions over the next few years. One"},{"t":"thing is already clear, she says: the relationship between education and economic growth","y":0.56242638384787691,"w":0.70576131184895829,"x":0.16049382957010172,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1},{"y":0.57848837231113737,"h":0.016034595817503106,"t":"is far from straightforward. 'German-speaking central Europe is an excellent laboratory","x":0.15843622239352262,"c":1,"w":0.70164606730143242},{"t":"for testing theories of economic growth,' she explains. Between 1600 and 1900, literacy","h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.15843622549711645,"y":0.59593023241190868,"w":0.70164606730143242},{"y":0.6133686690849014,"c":1,"h":0.015991796172268979,"x":0.1584362226846209,"t":"rates and book ownership were high and yet the region remained poor. It was also the case","w":0.72016459147135414},{"y":0.62926972888132371,"w":0.72222223917643236,"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.16049381858982562,"t":"that local guilds and merchant associations were extremely powerful and legislated against","c":1},{"h":0.017470964132967226,"y":0.6438953490240934,"w":0.67695470174153649,"t":"anything that undermined their monopolies. In villages throughout the region, guilds","c":1,"x":0.15843623567758547},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.66279069752794662,"t":"blocked labour migration and resisted changes that might reduce their influence.","w":0.64403289794921881,"c":1,"x":0.15843622581063624},{"w":0.72645222981770829,"x":0.15837292856535251,"y":0.69461756631156946,"c":1,"h":0.017509936724731334,"t":"'Early findings suggest that the potential benefits of education for the economy can be held"},{"y":0.71075581414037248,"h":0.017453844050215328,"c":1,"w":0.70576131184895829,"t":"back by other barriers, and this has implications for today,'says Ogilvie. 'Huge amounts","x":0.15843621925556192},{"t":"are spent improving education in developing countries, but this spending can fail to deliver","c":1,"x":0.16049383491467201,"w":0.72633743286132812,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.72965116267096364},{"c":1,"x":0.16255143082940435,"w":0.72839508056640623,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"economic growth if restrictions block people - especially women and the poor - from using","y":0.74558303881436916},{"c":1,"x":0.15836731063773754,"h":0.018895258190213426,"y":0.76007758814235782,"t":"their education in economically productive ways. If economic institutions are poorly set up,","w":0.73266525268554683},{"x":0.1604208574097051,"t":"for instance, education can't lead to growth.'","w":0.35822263081868488,"y":0.7775818770036742,"h":0.01645258205939526,"c":1},{"x":0.11728395082332468,"y":0.8677325578911671,"w":0.024691357612609877,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"86"},{"h":0.035152653221247165,"c":1,"y":0.95314993691982619,"x":0.66984496081179823,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.30619837443033859}],"w":2400}